  "queuename": "Omega Sling (Milky Way Bar Crawl | 07-2026)",
  "ImporterDescription": "Mods that will be installed by install group:\r\n - Unofficial LE2 Patch\r\n - Myriad Pro Begone (LE2)\r\n - LE2 Prologue Framework\r\n - Genesis Begone (LE2)\r\n - No Headgear for Squadmates\r\n - Casual Hubs for LE2\r\n - Skip Mini Games\r\n - One Probe All Resources\r\n - LE2 Changes For Import Credits 500.000\r\n - Shorter Notifications (LE2)\r\n - EGM Fix Weapons in Cutscenes LE2\r\n - Let Me Stay (LE2)\r\n - FISH (Minus Kelly)\r\n - Fish Feeder Mod\r\n - Fate of Executor Pallin (LE2)\r\n - Pilot In Location On Time\r\n - Stop Auto-Equipping Weapons\r\n - Overlord Morality Fix\r\n - M-44 Battle Tank (LE2)\r\n - Hugo Gernsback Consistency Mod\r\n - Early-Ish\r\n - Shortest Interrogation Ever (LE2)\r\n - All VIP Club Encounters\r\n - Reformatted Emails\r\n - Open My Ship (LE2)\r\n - Permanent CIC Holograms\r\n - Platonic Post Horizon Emails\r\n - Apollo Spacesuit Restoration\r\n - Wrex/Wreav Consistency Mod (LE2)\r\n - Samara Cut Shadow Broker Dossiers Restored\r\n - Instant Shadow Broker Rewards\r\n - Earlier Cabin Invites\r\n - Reaper Fight Timer LE2\r\n - DLC Timings Mod\r\n - Cerberus Daily News Emails\r\n - Zaeed's Wholesome Revenge (LE2)\r\n - Nos Astra Mineral Exchange\r\n - Geth Retrofits (LE2)\r\n - Modern Weapon Pack\r\n - Expanded Shepard Armory (ESA) LE2\r\n - Expanded Squadmate Armory (ESA Addon) LE2\r\n - Extended Romance Scenes\r\n - Liara Consistency Mod (ME2LE)\r\n - Liara's Alternate LE3 Armor for LotSB (LE2)\r\n - Unique Udina Face Restored LE2\r\n - Aria Consistency Mod\r\n - Quarian Admiralty Board Consistency Mod (MELE2)\r\n - Oriana looks like Miranda's Twin (ME2LE)\r\n - Cerberus/Alliance Uniform Consistency\r\n - Cerberus Ladies Wear Cerberus\r\n - Kelly & Kenson Restoration\r\n - Early Recruitment\r\n - Anderson & Hackett Consistency Mod\r\n - Sheploo Appearance Consistency Project\r\n - Kasumi Eye Tweak LE2\r\n - Improved Normandy Crash Site Flashback Textures\r\n - Kaidan & Ashley LE3 Armors for Horizon (MELE2)\r\n - Subtle Ammo Icons (LE2)\r\n - Extended Galaxy Map LE2 BETA\r\n - Interactive Intai'sei Apartment (LE2)\r\n - A Lot of Videos for LE2\r\n - AutoTOC (ASI mod)\r\n - PNG Screenshots (ASI mod)\r\n - Texture Override (ASI mod)\r\n\nImporting will add this install group to Batch Installer. This does not import any of the listed mods."
